          "items": [
            "Magnolia Cottage is...<br>a recently remodeled cottage with a well thought out floor plan <br><br>- 3 bedrooms on the 1st floor<br><br>- Complimentary, private GraytLife Rentals bonfire for you & your guests (staying in the home with you) for stays that are 5 nights or more<br><br>- Private Heated Pool (20ft. x 11.5 ft.) <br>*Enjoy a warm, comfortable swim any time of year! Pool heating is available for an additional $25 per night (from check in to check out).<br><br>**Pool heating is completely optional. Simply let us know your preference after booking your stay.<br> <br>- 5 minute walk to the beach <br><br>- 5 adult bikes (unisex beach cruisers)<br> <br>- Large gas grill (propane tank available but will need to be filled)<br><br>- Outdoor Shower<br><br>- 4 dedicated parking spots<br><br>- ALL linens laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: <br>This home offers 5 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, a private pool, a short 5 minute walk, bike or golf cart ride to the beach and wonderful accommodations for up to 15 guests! <br><br>Tranquil interiors and refreshing coastal décor set the stage for a relaxing and peaceful getaway. The first floor’s open-concept floorplan welcomes guests to relax and enjoy time together. The living room offers ample seating for your entire group along with a fully-stocked kitchen for all your cooking needs.<br><br>On the first floor, <br>there are 3 bedrooms each with a private full bath as well as a ½ bath in the hallway leading to the back half of the home. Across from the king master bedroom, there is a twin daybed under the stairway.<br> <br>On the second floor,<br>there are 4 twin beds in one room with a full bath attached. This room is great for kids or even adults! Across the hall, there is a room with 2 full platform beds. <br><br>Guests in this home will love the sparkling private pool and the spacious pool deck with lots of seating. Enjoy a freshly prepared dinner on the large gas grill or take a stroll to enjoy the delectable bites and delicious drinks at Chiringo or Red Bar—two of Grayton Beach’s best local spots. <br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br><br>FIRST FLOOR:<br><br> - Master Bedroom: King Bed, private full bath, LCD/HD flat screen TV <br><br> - Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, private full bath<br><br>- Twin daybed under stairway<br><br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, private full bath<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br><br>- Guest Bedroom: 4 twin beds, private full bath <br><br>- Guest Bedroom: 2 full-size beds, LCD/HD flat screen TV<br><br>No parties allowed at this home. Should there be damage from your stay, you will be subject to pay for all damaged items.",
